140
00:11:29,350 --> 00:11:30,180
Say something.

141
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:31,140
Brother.

142
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:32,450
Talk to me.

143
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,020
