147
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:43,260
Brother?

148
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:50,730
How did this happen?

149
00:12:18,230 --> 00:12:18,730
Brother?

150
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:20,610
Brother?

151
00:12:36,630 --> 00:12:37,490
