201
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,850
No outsider can possibly get through.

202
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,890
I need your help

203
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,650
to get us through the toxic gas

204
00:15:19,150 --> 00:15:20,850
and into the depths of the Xumi Realm,

205
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:22,820
so we can

206
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,770
