210
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,610
It's called Star-Moon Sand.

211
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,980
It's in the deepest part of the Xumi Realm.

212
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,340
Help me find the Star-Moon Sand,

213
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,770
