223
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:23,980
and have them lead the way.

224
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:26,250
Then they'll find the Star-Moon Sand.

225
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:28,180
Zhainiangniang aren't dogs.

226
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,340
It's hard enough keeping them from attacking people!

227
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,610
Don't you have dogs?

228
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,220
Why not have them find it for you?

229
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:48,770
There is actually

230
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,980
some Star-Moon Sand inside this tower,

231
