237
00:17:35,310 --> 00:17:36,980
as soon as they smell it.

238
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:39,460
Only the Zhainiangniang are immune to it.

239
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:41,140
Why?

240
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:44,250
Because Star-Moon Sand is actually

241
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:45,730
