245
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,290
into Star-Moon Sand.

246
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,090
Amazing, isn't it?

247
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,420
When Yin Changsheng's pills

248
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,460
