287
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:09,660
Star-Moon Sand.

288
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:11,490
It's Star-Moon Sand.

289
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,660
Everything Hatoyama

290
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,140
