what Hatoyama's hound's reaction

295
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:23,770
meant.

296
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,660
It had lost its memory

297
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,530
and forgotten its master.

298
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,090
That's why it became frightened

299
00:20:30,510 --> 00:20:31,180
and agitated.

300
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:34,770
The Star-Moon Sand in that jar

301
00:20:35,030 --> 00:20:36,660
can make animals lose their memories.

302
00:20:37,270 --> 00:20:38,420
But we inhaled it too.

303
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,140
Why

304
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:41,050
didn't we lose our memories?

305
00:20:44,350 --> 00:20:44,980
Those dogs

306
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,810
didn't lose all their memories either.

307
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:48,380
They still remembered

308
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,180
how to follow commands,

309
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,570
but they no longer recognized their masters.

310
00:20:52,590 --> 00:20:53,810
Could we be the same?

311
00:20:54,750 --> 00:20:55,770
We inhaled Star-Moon Sand

312
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,250
inside the Otherworld Tower

313
00:20:58,310 --> 00:20:59,620
and then forgot certain things.

314
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:01,900
Master Zhang,

315
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:03,140
what did we forget

316
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,460
in the Otherworld Tower?

317
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,050
My memory seems perfectly intact.

318
00:21:06,110 --> 00:21:06,810
When the human brain

319
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:09,090
loses a piece of memory,

320
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,330
it fills the gap with imagination.

321
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,460
So the brain can never realize

322
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,810
what it's forgotten.

323
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,350
Sometimes, you feel certain

324
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:19,730
that something happened.

325
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,050
But when you check the records,

326
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:21,900
you may find that it

327
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:22,730
never happened at all.

328
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:25,900
That's how the brain fills in the gaps.

329
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,460
What did we forget

330
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:29,380
inside the Otherworld Tower?

331
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:31,570
Good heavens.

332
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:34,180
We forgot time itself.

333
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:35,770
What do you mean?

334
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,530
We forgot

335
00:21:36,550 --> 00:21:37,530
the order of events

336
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,330
and mixed up the past,

337
00:21:40,270 --> 00:21:41,380
the future, and the present.

338
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,490
We also forgot

339
00:21:43,510 --> 00:21:44,900
how much time had passed.

340
00:21:56,350 --> 00:21:57,140
I understand.

341
00:21:58,590 --> 00:21:59,290
I understand now!

342
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:00,700
Don't be fooled by appearances.

343
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,140
There aren't countless Otherworld Towers.

344
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:03,220
There's only

345
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,700
one Otherworld Tower in Changsha.

346
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,900
We've been fooled by time.

347
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:11,140
What do you mean, Laogou?

348
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:13,220
We know there's only one Otherworld Tower in Changsha.

349
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:15,180
How did time fool us?

350
00:22:15,550 --> 00:22:16,810
We're the ones with the problem.

351
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:20,140
There's only one Otherworld Tower in Changsha,

352
00:22:20,270 --> 00:22:20,860
but there are

353
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:23,380
countless versions of us.

354
00:22:24,750 --> 00:22:25,380
Laogou,

355
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,090
can you not talk in riddles?

356
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:29,050
Tell me.

357
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:30,570
How many times have we

358
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:31,330
entered the Otherworld Tower?

359
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:32,660
How many could there be?

360
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,140
Just once.

361
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:34,770
No.

362
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:38,380
It wasn't just once.

363
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,330
We entered it countless times.

364
00:22:42,590 --> 00:22:43,180
Exactly.

365
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:47,570
Every time we left the Otherworld Tower,

366
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:49,570
we forgot everything.

367
00:22:56,830 --> 00:22:58,050
We all believed

368
00:22:59,110 --> 00:23:00,220
we'd never entered it before,

369
00:23:01,070 --> 00:23:02,460
so we'd go back inside

370
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:04,250
and repeat everything we'd already done.

371
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,490
Every time we entered,

372
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,900
we were searching for Unit 401.

373
00:23:08,550 --> 00:23:09,370
But once we caught up with them,

374
00:23:09,370 --> 00:23:10,220
we'd forget it all.

375
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:12,250
Only the memory of pursuing them would remain.

376
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,830
That's why we could never catch them.

377
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:17,770
Think back carefully.

378
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:19,570
Inside the tower,

379
00:23:20,310 --> 00:23:21,220
didn't it seem like we never

380
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,180
ate or slept at all?

381
00:23:22,590 --> 00:23:23,050
That's right.

382
00:23:24,510 --> 00:23:25,180
And there were

383
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,290
those wounds that appeared from nowhere.

384
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,220
But we did eat.

385
00:23:37,070 --> 00:23:37,980
And we did get hurt.

386
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:39,900
When did you hurt your hand?

387
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:42,730
I... I don't know.

388
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,900
We've lost all those memories.

389
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:47,250
Our memories

390
00:23:47,270 --> 00:23:47,940
are all wrong,

391
00:23:48,550 --> 00:23:49,330
all jumbled up.

392
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,380
And we never even realized it.

393
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:53,530
So we pieced those false memories

394
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:54,660
together

395
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:56,180
and took them as one complete memory.

396
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,180
So our memories

397
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,490
were pieced together from countless trips

398
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,900
into the Otherworld Tower.

399
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:08,290
Laogou,

400
00:24:09,790 --> 00:24:10,730
then how did Xiangu and the others

401
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:12,380
come back from the dead?

402
00:24:12,750 --> 00:24:13,730
It had to do with a candle ritual.

403
00:24:15,350 --> 00:24:16,490
I remember some of it.

404
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,620
We were convinced the shadow

405
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:19,290
was behind the door.

406
00:24:22,510 --> 00:24:23,530
We decided to make it think

407
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,660
its plan had worked.

408
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:27,730
To fool it,

409
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,490
I pretended to grieve.

410
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,330
That memory

411
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,660
then got mixed with another one.

412
00:24:35,530 --> 00:24:36,480
Burn Candles to Prolong Life.

413
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,140
Ascend to Heaven.

414
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,490
Peer into the Future.

415
00:24:42,550 --> 00:24:43,860
I'll light these candles,

416
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,730
but my people

417
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,250
must all be returned to me.

418
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,420
My mind filled in the gap

419
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,250
with me bringing my companions back to life.

420
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,090
As for the magic

421
00:24:56,110 --> 00:24:57,250
we thought we'd seen,

422
00:24:58,070 --> 00:24:59,380
it was just the result of us inhaling

423
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:01,050
Star-Moon Sand in the tower,

424
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,290
losing our memories,

425
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:04,140
piecing together

426
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:04,980
separate events,

427
00:25:05,830 --> 00:25:06,770
and hallucinating.

428
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:18,620
That's it?

429
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:19,490
That's it.

430
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:20,900
That's all?

431
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:24,860
Where's the door?

432
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,380
Why hasn't it opened?

433
00:25:40,480 --> 00:25:41,770
Before the waterway collapsed,

434
00:25:42,510 --> 00:25:43,730
we'd really found a hidden door.

435
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,570
There's a hidden door.

436
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:50,050
Stay here and stand by.

437
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:51,140
Yes.

438
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:53,380
So, Laogou, you mean,

439
00:25:53,590 --> 00:25:54,730
though it looked like my ritual

440
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,330
sent Master Zhang instantly from Liunian Hall

441
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,180
to the Underworld,

442
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:59,220
the truth is that the ritual

443
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:00,050
triggered a mechanism?

444
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:00,770
That can't be right.

445
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,900
I remember another ritual was performed

446
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,380
to send Fifth Master over.

447
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,900
At the time, we all believed

448
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,010
Master Zhang had been transported there.

449
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:08,220
So was that whole part

450
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,250
something we imagined?

451
00:26:09,510 --> 00:26:10,530
The part we've forgotten

452
00:26:12,370 --> 00:26:13,980
was from another trip into the tower.

453
00:26:14,350 --> 00:26:14,900
Tiezui,

454
00:26:15,590 --> 00:26:16,250
perform the ritual for me.

455
00:26:17,270 --> 00:26:18,420
If I really don't come back,

456
00:26:19,790 --> 00:26:20,940
follow Eighth Master's lead in civil matters.

457
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:23,090
For martial affairs,

458
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:26,620
follow Miss Huo's lead.

459
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:31,620
And at first,

460
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,460
none of you noticed Xiangu,

461
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:33,900
did you?

462
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:35,380
Then suddenly,

463
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,220
everyone knew she was there.

464
00:26:36,590 --> 00:26:37,940
Don't you think something is missing?

465
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,220
Tiezui, perform the ritual.

466
00:26:40,030 --> 00:26:40,490
Laogou...

467
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:41,140
- Stop dawdling! - I...

468
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:42,660
Hurry.

469
00:26:51,030 --> 00:26:51,570
Laogou,

470
00:26:53,270 --> 00:26:54,620
what about the hand on the ceiling?

471
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:56,530
That came from two separate memories

472
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:57,810
from two different

473
00:26:57,830 --> 00:26:58,620
trips down there.

474
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,290
Master Zhang disappeared.

475
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:01,900
We split up to search,

476
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:03,770
but neither side could reach the other.

477
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:05,660
Only a narrow gap connected us.

478
00:27:06,550 --> 00:27:07,620
I gave Xiangu the button I found

479
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,420
from Master Zhang.

480
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:10,660
At the time, she didn't trust Master Zhang,

481
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,050
so those memories were stitched

482
00:27:12,070 --> 00:27:12,900
into something strange.

483
00:27:16,270 --> 00:27:17,620
But why didn't we

484
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,570
notice

485
00:27:19,270 --> 00:27:20,320
that everyone's memories

486
00:27:20,320 --> 00:27:21,220
had been altered?

487
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:23,090
Because we never

488
00:27:23,110 --> 00:27:24,890
put everyone's memories together

489
00:27:24,890 --> 00:27:25,770
and compared them.

490
00:27:26,590 --> 00:27:28,180
It's possible that from the very beginning,

491
00:27:28,830 --> 00:27:30,570
we all remembered things differently.

492
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:31,530
Exactly.

493
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:33,490
There's another possibility.

494
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,490
Some emotions,

495
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,180
like fear,

496
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:39,180
can make us dread the same outcome

497
00:27:39,830 --> 00:27:40,620
and instinctively

498
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:41,530
expect the worst.

499
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:43,250
In the end,

500
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,980
the events themselves become blurred,

501
00:27:45,790 --> 00:27:47,220
while the fear

502
00:27:48,110 --> 00:27:49,290
gets etched into our bones.

503
00:27:50,350 --> 00:27:51,460
Everything we imagined,

504
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:53,220
everything that really happened,

505
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:54,730
and all the overlapping memories

506
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:55,530
from each trip

507
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,900
got mixed together.

508
00:28:19,340 --> 00:28:20,820
[You've entered the Otherworld Tower countless times.]

509
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:22,730
"You've entered the Otherworld Tower countless times.

510
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:29,010
Here's the secret of the Otherworld Tower's spells:

511
00:28:30,030 --> 00:28:31,140
everything you've experienced

512
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:33,140
is both real and false.

513
00:28:34,160 --> 00:28:35,700
They are all your memories.

514
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:38,860
The sand makes your memory lie to you."

515
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:42,770
I remember now.

516
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,420
Back in Changsha, we'd already

517
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,250
entered the Otherworld Tower

518
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:48,010
who knows

519
00:28:48,030 --> 00:28:49,090
how many times.

520
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,290
The Otherworld Patriarch

521
00:28:54,310 --> 00:28:55,380
was never real.

522
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:57,180
It was all in my imagination.

523
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:06,490
This morning glory must also be

524
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:07,900
a mark I left for myself.

525
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:13,140
Listen.

526
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,620
Let's split up and search.

527
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:15,700
In one incense stick's time,

528
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:16,660
we'll meet back here.

529
00:30:42,500 --> 00:30:43,540
[Hua Clan of Xishan]

530
00:30:43,540 --> 00:30:44,900
[Fang Zhongli of Rongjiang]

531
00:30:44,900 --> 00:30:49,140
[Jiangning Embroidery Workshop, Lin Lanqing]

532
00:30:57,140 --> 00:31:00,100
[Workshop owner Lin Lanqing]

533
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:02,100
[The workshop rushed a silk order for the Imperial Household Department]

534
00:31:07,700 --> 00:31:08,980
[Artisans fled]

535
00:31:08,980 --> 00:31:13,660
[Favored by the Otherworld Patriarch]

536
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:23,490
That dream of the afterlife

537
00:31:24,550 --> 00:31:26,090
was only the life story of a believer.

538
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:27,700
I turned it

539
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,050
into a false memory of my past life.

540
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:34,900
All of this

541
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:37,620
was a trap set by Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

542
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:41,010
He truly knows Star-Moon Sand well.

543
00:31:42,110 --> 00:31:43,180
He laid one trap after another,

544
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:45,570
drawing us deeper and deeper,

545
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,380
and throwing our memories into chaos

546
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,180
until we couldn't recover

547
00:31:50,830 --> 00:31:51,860
a trace of what really happened.

548
00:32:04,030 --> 00:32:04,860
Good.

549
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,050
Take his men away.

550
00:32:08,110 --> 00:32:09,180
Given Wu Laogou's temperament,

551
00:32:10,030 --> 00:32:11,620
he must have lost control by now.

552
00:32:12,790 --> 00:32:13,700
Find a way to get him

553
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:16,700
and Zhang Qishan away from the group.

554
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:41,050
If Wu Laogou wants to save them,

555
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:45,010
he'll have to go deep into the Otherworld Tower.

556
00:32:46,590 --> 00:32:47,660
He didn't have to

557
00:32:47,920 --> 00:32:51,810
put himself in such danger.

558
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:53,660
All of this

559
00:32:54,070 --> 00:32:55,180
is because he agreed

560
00:32:55,790 --> 00:32:57,330
to help Zhang Qishan.

561
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:12,980
So,

562
00:33:13,510 --> 00:33:15,420
inside Changsha's Otherworld Tower,

563
00:33:15,890 --> 00:33:17,530
we made up a complete story

564
00:33:17,550 --> 00:33:18,770
of our exploration.

565
00:33:19,590 --> 00:33:20,330
We filled in the gaps

566
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,090
in our memories with imagination.

567
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:23,900
No wonder

568
00:33:24,750 --> 00:33:25,490
we seemed to go instantly

569
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:26,810
from Liunian Hall

570
00:33:26,830 --> 00:33:27,730
to the great ghost palace,

571
00:33:28,350 --> 00:33:29,250
yet we could never find

572
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,330
any flaw in those mechanisms.

573
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:31,770
Yin Changsheng

574
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:33,140
and the Otherworld Patriarch

575
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:34,980
must have used

576
00:33:35,110 --> 00:33:36,050
these confused memories

577
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:38,180
to create their so-called magic.

578
00:33:38,830 --> 00:33:39,620
When Hatoyama

579
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,620
brought me here,

580
00:33:41,510 --> 00:33:42,660
I suddenly realized

581
00:33:43,350 --> 00:33:43,860
that here,

582
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:45,620
the towers went on endlessly.

583
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,250
But in Changsha,

584
00:33:48,110 --> 00:33:49,490
we were the ones caught in a loop.

585
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,730
That's why you drew

586
00:33:56,790 --> 00:33:57,940
such a huge clock face here.

587
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:02,220
Time is the key to the mystery.

588
00:34:02,750 --> 00:34:05,220
It was all caused by inhaling Star-Moon Sand.

589
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:07,860
So Yin Changsheng's spells

590
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:09,380
were fake,

591
00:34:09,550 --> 00:34:10,380
nothing but tricks.

592
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,650
Then what about Ding Qiansui?

593
00:34:12,110 --> 00:34:13,210
He wasn't in the Otherworld Tower.

594
00:34:13,590 --> 00:34:15,340
We saw him die from magic ourselves.

595
00:34:15,510 --> 00:34:16,570
Zhang Qishan,

596
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:20,260
you think far too highly of yourself.

597
00:34:20,630 --> 00:34:21,980
Since I know

598
00:34:22,070 --> 00:34:23,900
how the magic works,

599
00:34:24,590 --> 00:34:25,940
I can

600
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:28,780
reverse time itself!

601
00:34:33,230 --> 00:34:34,300
The Star-Moon Sand he used

602
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,050
still affected you.

603
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:37,820
Your memory became confused,

604
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,460
and you let Ding Qiansui go.

605
00:34:46,150 --> 00:34:47,610
But the mutated shadowy figure killed him.

606
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,340
His body was made to look

607
00:34:49,360 --> 00:34:50,380
as though he'd been disemboweled.

608
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:52,610
They used Star-Moon Sand to control your guards

609
00:34:53,190 --> 00:34:54,340
and had them bring the body back.

610
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,050
Those two memories were pieced together,

611
00:34:56,550 --> 00:34:57,900
making it seem the magic had worked.

612
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:08,490
Then are we still

613
00:35:08,510 --> 00:35:09,780
under the effects of Star-Moon Sand?

614
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:10,900
Star-Moon Sand only appears

615
00:35:11,190 --> 00:35:12,090
where spells are being used.

616
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,340
Even if there is some here,

617
00:35:14,110 --> 00:35:15,050
we've already been exposed.

618
00:35:15,670 --> 00:35:16,420
It's too late to cover up now.

619
00:35:17,670 --> 00:35:18,530
As I remember it,

620
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:20,300
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

621
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,210
was barely affected by Star-Moon Sand.

622
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:23,170
That means

623
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:24,460
he already found

624
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,090
a way to neutralize its effects.

625
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:27,420
Ultimately,

626
00:35:27,880 --> 00:35:28,860
it all comes down

627
00:35:29,630 --> 00:35:31,420
to Star-Moon Sand,

628
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:32,340
the scales

629
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:33,900
shed by Zhainiangniang.

630
00:35:34,710 --> 00:35:35,490
It can throw memories

631
00:35:35,510 --> 00:35:36,260
into chaos

632
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:37,340
and even cause hallucinations.

633
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:40,170
But it gets used up very quickly.

634
00:35:41,230 --> 00:35:42,820
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was trying to reach

635
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:43,820
the Xumi Realm's

636
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:45,130
innermost chamber

637
00:35:46,230 --> 00:35:47,340
because inside that chamber

638
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,650
was a large amount of what he wanted:

639
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:51,530
Star-Moon Sand.

640
00:36:09,180 --> 00:36:13,340
♪The past fades like smoke♪

641
00:36:13,700 --> 00:36:16,420
♪A choice is made in silence♪

642
00:36:16,700 --> 00:36:19,500
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

643
00:36:19,900 --> 00:36:23,660
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

644
00:36:23,900 --> 00:36:27,340
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

645
00:36:27,620 --> 00:36:31,020
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

646
00:36:31,100 --> 00:36:38,380
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

647
00:36:38,820 --> 00:36:42,100
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

648
00:36:42,380 --> 00:36:45,620
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

649
00:36:45,780 --> 00:36:49,820
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

650
00:36:50,020 --> 00:36:53,380
♪Who believes in fate?♪

651
00:36:53,620 --> 00:36:56,980
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

652
00:36:57,220 --> 00:37:00,500
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

653
00:37:00,820 --> 00:37:04,500
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

654
00:37:04,700 --> 00:37:07,940
♪Take care♪

655
00:37:07,940 --> 00:37:10,500
♪We once raced♪

656
00:37:10,580 --> 00:37:12,500
♪For the dawn♪

657
00:37:12,660 --> 00:37:15,940
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

658
00:37:16,060 --> 00:37:19,340
♪In the web of fate♪

659
00:37:19,340 --> 00:37:22,540
♪No one can escape♪

660
00:37:23,540 --> 00:37:25,380
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

661
00:37:25,540 --> 00:37:27,100
♪We too were young once♪

662
00:37:27,180 --> 00:37:30,620
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

663
00:37:30,820 --> 00:37:33,140
♪Keep the ember lit♪

664
00:37:33,260 --> 00:37:37,780
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

665
00:37:37,900 --> 00:37:40,860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

666
00:37:41,100 --> 00:37:44,620
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

667
00:37:44,740 --> 00:37:48,500
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

668
00:37:48,820 --> 00:37:52,300
♪Who believes in fate?♪

669
00:37:52,460 --> 00:37:55,460
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

670
00:37:55,700 --> 00:37:59,460
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

671
00:37:59,620 --> 00:38:03,340
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

672
00:38:03,460 --> 00:38:14,900
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
